8. Dual Booking System — Critical Functionality
Customers must be able to book every service through two clearly visible methods.

Booking Method A: Book Through a Professional Firm
Workflow:

Customer selects a service.

Customer clicks Book with a Professional Firm.

System displays qualified firms offering that service.

Customer filters by location, price, specialization, rating, and availability.

Customer selects a firm.

Customer chooses the desired service package.

Customer selects consultation mode:

Online consultation.

Telephone consultation.

Physical office visit.

On-site business visit.

Customer selects available appointment date and time.

Customer enters business and contact details.

Customer provides requirements and optionally uploads relevant documents.

System displays a booking summary.

Customer submits booking or makes payment if required.

System generates a unique booking reference.

Customer and provider receive booking notifications.

Customer can view, reschedule, or cancel according to the booking policy.

The provider dashboard must allow firms to accept, decline, reschedule, complete, and manage appointments.

Booking Method B: Direct WhatsApp Booking
Every service card, service details page, and package must include a Book via WhatsApp button.

Use the official MsmeBooks business WhatsApp number:

+2349158482622

Create dynamic WhatsApp deep links using the official wa.me format.

Example:

https://wa.me/2349158482622?text=Hello%20MsmeBooks%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20book%20an%20Accounting%20Consultation.

Automatically prefill the WhatsApp message with available booking context:

Service name.

Selected package.

Preferred consultation method.

Selected firm, if applicable.

Preferred appointment date and time, if provided.

Booking reference, if already generated.

Example WhatsApp booking message:

Hello MsmeBooks,

I would like to book a professional service.

Service: Monthly Bookkeeping

Preferred Provider: MsmeBooks Professional Services

Consultation Type: Online

Preferred Date: To be confirmed

Please share the service requirements, pricing, and next available appointment.

Thank you.

Do not place sensitive financial records, private customer information, or uploaded documents into the WhatsApp URL.

For bookings with a selected firm, support the firm's verified WhatsApp business number where authorized, while keeping MsmeBooks as the fallback contact.

Important: Clicking WhatsApp opens a conversation; it must not automatically mark the booking as confirmed. Only confirmed provider acceptance should change booking status.

